    74	12. Bootstrap contract: one shared draw per replicate (Δ*, G*, R* from the same indices — checked by injecting a query whose exclusion changes all three); shared mask excludes a query invalid in any of `e_0`, `e_α`, `g_α`; exclusion counts by cause; seeded reproducibility; synthetic shift recovered inside the CI; status `defined` / `improvement` / `denominator uncertain` / `undefined` each hit by a fixture (including exact-zero draws counted, not dropped); empty mask → reported as n = 0 with no interval, no exception.
    75	13. Room-cluster bootstrap: drawn-room multiplicities preserved and query-weighted (a fixture with unequal room sizes where per-room averaging would give a different answer).
    76	14. Controls table: flags `ctrl_full_turn` / `ctrl_zero_repeat` / `ctrl_k128_repeat` mismatches > 1e-6 (waveform and log-spec) and > 1e-9 on acoustic metrics.
    77	15. Figure/CSV: files written; signed negative bars rendered; CSV rows equal the JSON values; refuses a JSON whose input sha256s do not match disk.
    78	16. Run-identity guard: the summariser refuses to combine Δ, G or R from per-sample files with different `run_id`s (e.g. a CPU run's gaps with exp_03's GPU errors); historical exp_03 values can only enter a separately labelled "historical comparison" table.
